# Set the API key that matches whichever provider you pass via --model (default: Anthropic).
# This script is AI-first: the first time it sees a job source, and any time it falls back to
# repair a broken selector, it calls this model. Only the key for your chosen provider is
# required — you don't need all of these.

# --model anthropic/claude-3-7-sonnet-latest  (the default)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --model openai/gpt-4o
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --model novita/<model-id>  (e.g. novita/deepseek/deepseek-v3 — see https://novita.ai/models for IDs)
# NOVITA_API_KEY=

# Any other litellm-supported provider works the same way — set that provider's usual env var
# (GOOGLE_API_KEY, GROQ_API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY, ...) and pass --model <provider>/<model>.
# See python/README.md for the full provider table, or override the key directly with --api-key.

# Optional: change the default model without passing --model every time.
# STAGEHAND_MODEL=anthropic/claude-3-7-sonnet-latest
